# tally 2.1.7 S2 (#101): a priced reference's field that its record doesn't have is LOAD-FIELD (L §8.3), as any
# field read is. Was (2.1.6): REFCORE-NOT-YET.
=== bad_field.tally
model pr
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "synthetic"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit etf "fund unit"

place fund: holdings etf priced fp.price lives 2026-01-01..

input fp: (nav num PLN/etf, note text) reading

ask a4: value(fund, 2026-03-01) in PLN law 2026-06-30

version v1
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  fp = (nav: 12.50 PLN/etf, note: "x") at 2026-03-01 "wycena"
  opening[fund] = 10 etf at 2026-01-01 start "own"
=== expect
refused: LOAD-FIELD price is not a field of (nav num PLN/etf, note text) ...
